    "created_at": "2025-07-18T03:53:04Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-07-18T03:53:04Z",
    "body": "`-webkit-box-*` in general is mostly used to kick `-webkit-line-clamp` into doing anything; that said, Chrome's telemetry still puts its usage _without_ `-webkit-line-clamp` at [around 9%](https://chromestatus.com/metrics/feature/timeline/popularity/4355).\n\nReally someone needs to actually define how the legacy flexbox stuff actually works; see also https://github.com/whatwg/compat/issues/87 and https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/1946.",
