    "created_at": "2025-10-25T17:35:21Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-10-25T17:35:21Z",
    "body": "> As a side note, do we really need these as a mandatory thing?\n\nAs long as browsers are still shipping support for them, probably... there's unfortunately a ton of sites that only included webkit prefixes (this was problematic for Opera when it was using Presto and Firefox before it added support for these prefixes).",
